{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_1000_situation", "source_sha256": "7058ecf94a0644406f0b2b3779ea114ac20fed2dff0e5b590208122cbc9466ff", "ja": "キャンペーンガールのお仕事　直前", "zh": "Show Girl的工作　开始前", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_1000_place", "source_sha256": "dc2eab181b21579d24af8758a5c8880d3a25c4048161584a8837b0a8c92754ca", "ja": "控え室", "zh": "准备室", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_1001_p", "source_sha256": "d05f8476f3bef5f87f04c6750f5503d7a190fcad6458079fe35a363126ecfb8a", "ja": "そろそろ準備しないとだけど……莉緒？\nどうしたんだ、衣装を見つめたりして。", "zh": "差不多该准备准备了……莉绪？\n你这样盯着服装看，是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_1002_046rio", "source_sha256": "8262bebe9e349af000e3458a9fc2a45e90365a29a027d8f58b55813a9847467e", "ja": "ねぇ、{$P$}くん。今回の衣装、\nもっとスカート短い方がカワイイと思わない？", "zh": "哎，{$P$}。你不觉得\n这次的服装，裙子再短一点比较可爱吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_1003_046rio", "source_sha256": "3acd8cb88a1279e75e641436f4046151a8d1a2f0d970d2d2038f21a76fa5bd06", "ja": "前も提案したんだけど、却下されちゃったのよね。私の\n脚線美を活かすには、絶対いいと思うんだけど……。", "zh": "我之前已经提议过，却被否决了呢。\n为了展现我的美腿，这样一定会比较好的说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_1004_p", "source_sha256": "ef1bc851b53fe3eb61566a1cf04632497aada80c7ee4923a647f1e6dd3215a78", "ja": "莉緒の言うことも、わからなくないけど……\n今のままでも、魅力は十分伝わると思うな。", "zh": "我也不是不明白莉绪的意思……\n但我觉得，现在这样就能完美展现魅力了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_1005_046rio", "source_sha256": "81dfbdf59f1f33c257de21bd3151a451e08d6422cfc1644911917a8c31d847b4", "ja": "あ、あら…そう？　{$P$}くんが\nそう言うなら、きっとそうよね！　ウフフ♪", "zh": "哎、哎呀……这样吗？既然{$P$}\n这么说了，那一定不会错呢！呵呵♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "job_story_046rio_1000_jp.gtx", "item_key": "job_story_046rio_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "e856f34f9c8a1c0dea5c351f6965a9afea25821aa7f9a7895b85a5583923bee8", "ja": "それじゃ、お仕事頑張ってくるわね。\n{$P$}くん、見ててね！", "zh": "那我就去努力工作啰。\n{$P$}，你要看好喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
